## The Cost of Non-Compliance: When Creative Wins Lead to Account Bans

Few experiences in digital marketing are more painful than launching a creative angle that achieves a 4.5x ROAS, only to wake up 48 hours later to find your **Meta Business Manager disabled**, your **TikTok ad account suspended**, and your conversion tracking pixels frozen.

In 2026, ad review systems are governed by multi-modal AI models that scan:
- **Automated speech-to-text transcripts** for prohibited medical and financial buzzwords.
- **Computer vision frame parsing** for split-screen body comparisons, extreme macro skin zooms, and fake UI elements.
- **Audio acoustic fingerprinting** for commercial music copyright infringement.

High-growth DTC brands cannot afford to treat compliance as an afterthought. You must design compliance **into your creative storyboarding process**.

